\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9.2}{\ignorespaces Enzymatic rate enhancements and partition depth saved. Uncatalysed rate constants $k_{\mathrm {uncat}}$ from Wolfenden \& Snider (2001); catalysed constants from BRENDA database. $\Delta \mathcal {M}_{\mathrm {saved}}$ computed as $\log _e(\text {rate enhancement})$ in natural partition units ($b = e$). Measured $\log _{10} k_{\mathrm {cat}}$ values correlate with predicted $\log _b b^{\Delta \mathcal {M}_{\mathrm {saved}}}$ at $r = 0.97$ across the full six-order-of-magnitude range.}}{132}{table.caption.11}%
